{"reviews":[{"id":"B07CNL2KQP-0","r":4.0,"t":"We really like these toothbrushes","x":"We really like these toothbrushes. I had been buying the charcoal bristled brushes made by Colgate, but wanted to try out a biodegradable variety. I don't use charcoal bristles for whitening or anything - i like that the bristles are soft enough to brush my gums as well as my teeth, but firm enough to still get all the plaque off. One word of advice - don't leave the handles where they will be wet most of the time. They can start smelling funky, and i'm sure that these can't be sanitized as well","h":11,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2018"},{"id":"B07CNL2KQP-1","r":5.0,"t":"Great swap for plastic toothbrushes.","x":"I am starting my plastic free, zero waste life style and I am replacing each item as it nears the time to be thrown out. I love these! Very well made and the shape is comfortable to hold.  The bristles appear securely placed so I don't think I will have issues with them falling out.","h":11,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2018"},{"id":"B07CNL2KQP-2","r":5.0,"t":"The earth is happy with this purchase","x":"Feels just like a normal toothbrush! Bristles aren\u2019t too hard but strong enough. We all have to do our part and this is a simple way we can all make a change!","h":6,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2018"},{"id":"B07CNL2KQP-3","r":1.0,"t":"Don\u2019t buy.","x":"I hate to say but don\u2019t  waste your money. These last about a week. The bristles become all smushed VERY quickly. May be bio degradable (which is why I bought them) but they wasted a lot of money making junk. Sorry to write such a bad review but this is my experience. I would select zero stars but you have to select at least one.","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2018"},{"id":"B07CNL2KQP-4","r":5.0,"t":"Soft, gentle bristles","x":"If you want a hard brush that makes your gums bleed, this is not the brush for you. I love it. Also, if you can't stand putting your teeth on a popsicle stick, you won't like a wooden toothbrush but I take that as a given.","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2018"},{"id":"B07CNL2KQP-5","r":4.0,"t":"Recommend","x":"Honestly these kind of gross me out how they feel but I am trying to be more environmentally friendly.  They work fine but are harder to keep looking clean.  I kept my plastic brush and reach for that instead.","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2018"},{"id":"B07CNL2KQP-6","r":1.0,"t":"Nope!","x":"Didn't like them and the last one I used and only had out for about a week started to mold. Yuck!! I even let it air dry and it still got mold on it. Was so disappointed I threw them all out.","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2018"},{"id":"B07CNL2KQP-7","r":5.0,"t":"Charcoal bristles for the win!","x":"I bought these because they are good for the environment. But I will keep buying them because the charcoal bristles clean my teeth better. The ergonomic handle is a bonus.","h":3,"v":0,"d":"Oct 2018"},{"id":"B07CNL2KQP-8","r":5.0,"t":"Great toothbrush","x":"Came in time. Great quality, perfect stiffness and durable handle. Will purchase again they are awesome! And better for our planet it's a win win.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2018"},{"id":"B07CNL2KQP-9","r":5.0,"t":"Five Stars","x":"Works great and is eco friendly. My only complaint is I wish it was easier to tell them apart.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2018"},{"id":"B07CNL2KQP-10","r":4.0,"t":"Although it met my expectations, others in the household were not as enthusiastic.","x":"I liked them because I am concerned about the overabundance of plastics in our environment and these use less;  the handles are bamboo.  The brush works fine for me, but others who tried them (you get four of them) complained that the bristles were too firm or too large to fit in their mouths.  They also did not like the feel of the handle as it felt like they were putting a stick in their mouths and it caused them to gag while brushing the back teeth.  They preferred the feel of the plastic bru","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2020"},{"id":"B07CNL2KQP-11","r":1.0,"t":"Made in China by a Chinese company for sure","x":"What called my attention when I received this box of toothbrushes were the many spelling mistakes on the box. Regardless, I went on to try the toothbrushes. First of all, the company claims that these have \"extra soft bristles green material,\" but these are not soft at all and the material of the bristles feels like plastic. Nevertheless, I insisted on using them because I understand that there should be a period of adjustment for new toothbrushes. My trials haven't been successful. My gums are ","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2018"},{"id":"B07CNL2KQP-12","r":5.0,"t":"Perfect!","x":"I absolutely love these. So good for the environment. The feeling of wood in my mouth took a bit of getting used to, but after about a week or two, it felt totally normal. I just leave mine upright in a toothbrush holder when I'm not using it, so it can dry.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2018"},{"id":"B07CNL2KQP-13","r":4.0,"t":"White teeth.","x":"I have noticed that my teeth are whiter. The bristles are super soft and go well with my sensitive teeth. I just feel like you have to buy both the brush and the tooth paste to see faster results. But I love the brush all the same.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2018"},{"id":"B07CNL2KQP-14","r":5.0,"t":"Awesome!","x":"Very pleased with these! Specially how they come in biodegradable packaging as well. I\u2019ve gotten bamboo toothbrushes that come in plastic packaging, and that defeats the purpose. Very happy to see a complete eco friendly product","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2018"},{"id":"B07CNL2KQP-15","r":5.0,"t":"buy them now","x":"these are wonderful. Ecofriendly product with eco friendly packaginy. Toothbrush works as it should and looks better in the bathroom than plastic. Stop using single use plastic, buy these","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2018"},{"id":"B07CNL2KQP-16","r":5.0,"t":"Great brushes!","x":"I love these toothbrushes!  Just the right balance of firm & soft.  I can\u2019t say for certain whether my teeth are whiter, but the texture of the bristles really makes my mouth feel clean!","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2018"},{"id":"B07CNL2KQP-17","r":4.0,"t":"Cleans well","x":"I really like these toothbrushes and they leave my teeth very clean. I was hoping the charcoal would help whiten my teeth, but no it doesn't.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2018"},{"id":"B07CNL2KQP-18","r":5.0,"t":"Great toothbrushes","x":"These brushes are wonderful.  The shape of the brush really helps clean your teeth and after two usages I noticed my teeth were whiter.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2018"},{"id":"B07CNL2KQP-19","r":4.0,"t":"Not Bad","x":"I like the wood & the bristles aren't too hard or too soft, but they sometimes fall out.  I'm glad it came in a 4pk.  Still not bad.","h":2,"v":0,"d":"Nov 2018"},{"id":"B07CNL2KQP-20","r":4.0,"t":"\ud83d\udc4d\ud83d\ude38\ud83d\ude38\ud83d\ude38\ud83d\udc4c","x":"So nice! These tooth brushes came earlier than I thought,very nice though and there eco friendly. A good switch \ud83d\ude04\u263a\ufe0f","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2018"},{"id":"B07CNL2KQP-21","r":5.0,"t":"Great product","x":"These are great! I haven\u2019t figured out why they are numbered. But I love the product. I\u2019ll be ordering again soon","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2018"},{"id":"B07CNL2KQP-22","r":5.0,"t":"Best bamboo toothbrush ever","x":"We have tried multiple bamboo toothbrushes and most were poorly made . Not these . They are great!!!","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2018"},{"id":"B07CNL2KQP-23","r":5.0,"t":"Eco friendly","x":"Helps you become more eco friendly and produce less waste\ud83d\udc4d\ud83c\udffc","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2018"},{"id":"B07CNL2KQP-24","r":4.0,"t":"Works good with the charcoal powder","x":"I use with my charcoal powder and it really works well.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2018"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Many reviewers praise these as a great eco-friendly swap for plastic toothbrushes, citing the biodegradable materials and packaging.","cites":[2,3,8,9,10,13,15]},{"text":"Several reviewers find the bristles soft and gentle, comfortable for sensitive teeth and gums.","cites":[1,3,5,14]},{"text":"Some reviewers report durability problems, with bristles becoming smushed quickly or the brush molding within about a week.","cites":[4,7]},{"text":"A few reviewers note the wooden handle takes getting used to or that bristles are too firm or too large for some users.","cites":[5,11,13]},{"text":"Some reviewers mention the brushes are harder to keep clean or that they reach for their plastic brush instead.","cites":[6,7]}]},"qa":[]}